# Keeps the docker build context small for the dogfood UI image.
# Without this, `docker compose build` from the repo root uploads the
# entire monorepo (.git, every workspace's node_modules, dist, etc.) to
# the daemon — slow enough that cycloid-app start can time out before
# the ready check passes.

.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
coverage
**/coverage
.wrangler
**/.wrangler
.venv
**/.venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__

# Local dev artifacts
*.log
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.DS_Store
